se {\n            minWin = 0;\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(minWin + \" \" + maxWin);\n        scanner.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00932132825255394, -0.0008912135381251574, -5.512236498361744e-07, -4.000763510703109e-05, -5.5577775128767826e-06, 0.0, -6.2729995988775045e-06, -1.068152904510498, -3.054500666621607e-06, 0.0, -3.128163257315464e-07, 0.0, -0.6354036331176758, -2.2200749754119897e-06, 0.0, -1.9361264946837764e-07, 0.0, -0.024790694937109947, -0.00043126524542458355, -1.7432603272027336e-06, -1.0280383548888494e-06, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.006899836007505655, -2.176947600673884e-05, -0.0005558936391025782, -1.2664456789934775e-06, -7.896309739408025e-07, -0.00015335931675508618, -0.007608989719301462, -0.00013285996101330966, -4.320199877838604e-07, 0.0, -7.896309739408025e-07, 0.0, -7.107425062713446e-06, -5.512236498361744e-07, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.00010998018842656165, -1.8550976164988242e-05, 0.0, -3.650518920039758e-06, -0.1603488326072693, -2.935296834039036e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.1427810788154602, -0.10032550245523453, -0.00010080150241265073, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -1.2664456789934775e-06, -5.512236498361744e-07, -0.34847068786621094, -1.1472419600977446e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.2664456789934775e-06, 0.0, -0.14535753428936005, -3.333223139634356e-05, -0.4296596348285675, -0.062059443444013596, -0.0004156568902544677, -7.896309739408025e-07, 0.0, -2.5776860184123507e-06, -7.896309739408025e-07, -2.6060808522743173e-05, -0.0021576376166194677, -0.0019353042589500546, -5.5577775128767826e-06, -5.5577775128767826e-06, 0.0, -9.627176768844947e-05, -0.42878109216690063, -1.318681188422488e-05, -2.2200749754119897e-06, -0.11282389611005783, -7.827200897736475e-05, -0.7042827010154724, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -2.816093228830141e-06, -7.3458322731312364e-06, -3.054500666621607e-06, -2.6537622034084052e-05, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.2811746597